# CAGE 4 Environment Documentation

## Hybrid agent (LLM + RL)

To run hybrid framework, where a LLM predicts high level action and then a RL agent selects a low level action, use this:
```
python './align-system/align_system/cli/LLM_HMARL.py' +experiment=phase2_july_collab/pipeline_baseline_hybrid_cage4
```
